2_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_11","text":"Is that so strange of me to want that?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_12","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_12","text":"It's just so sudden.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_13","text":"When you like someone,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_14","text":"you find yourself wanting to see them all the time.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_15","text":"In everyday moments, in sudden and unexpected ones.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_16","text":"All the time, really.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_17","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_17","text":"I like you too.","jump":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_19"},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_18","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_18","text":"I want to see you too.","jump":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_30"},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_19","text":"!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_20","text":"Oh, er...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_21","text":"I didn't expect that we'd take it this far.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_22","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_22","text":"I really do like you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_23","text":"!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_24","text":"O-okay!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_25","text":"That's enough!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_26","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_26","text":"What's wrong?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_27","text":"If you're gonna say stuff like that,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_28","text":"shouldn't you tell it to me in person","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_29","text":"instead of over Bla?","jump":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_31"},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_30","text":"All right then!","jump":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_31"},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_31","text":"Come and meet me at the Maid Cafe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_32","text":"We've got plenty of staff on hand,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_33","text":"so you won't get roped into working.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_34","text":"You can come as you are,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_35","text":"nice and relaxed.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_36","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_36","text":"All right, I'll come in sweats.","jump":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_38"},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_37","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_37","text":"All right. I haven't showered yet, but I'll head straight over.","jump":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_38"},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_38","text":"Um, actually, that might be a bit...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_39","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_39","text":"Didn't you say I could come as I was?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_40","text":"I meant that you could come here without any mental stress.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_41","text":"I didn't mean not to tend to your physical appearance.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_42","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_42","text":"Oh. Fair enough.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_43","text":"Aye, that be right!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_44","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_44","text":"All right, I'll head right over. We can eat together after you're done.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_45","text":"When I'm done with what?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_46","text":"Anyway,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_47","text":"sharing a meal sounds like a grand idea!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_48","text":"I'll prepare something special for you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_49","text":"The squishy-wishy ♥ boing-boing ♡ super-duper ☆special★!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_50","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02_50","text":"Haha, sounds good.","jump":null}],"chat":true}